    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/5c8cf99436cb99d338fdef1a938cba17.avif?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=179 /></span><br><br><strong>Cogs and Carnage</strong> is a roguelite topdown shooter with focus on fast paced fights and massive destruction. Adapt your mech to suit the playstyle you and your party need to succeed in a wide range of gamemodes, offering different objectives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/3964288618b2e8beeed67c2aa2e6f827.webp?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/4e8f977273a9c98bd6d8ff398688f969.poster.avif?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/4e8f977273a9c98bd6d8ff398688f969.webm?t=1731341974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Team up with friends or go solo and fight challenging enemies or other players.<br>Use simple controls to position yourself tactically, dodge incoming attacks or aim destructive skill-shots.  Engage in battles of all sizes, as you proof yourself against the toughest mech pilot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/e5b2a331731ddd1699853a2ada0ee027.webp?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/4abf0cc2f5b872601ee4f07b47e65ab8.poster.avif?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/4abf0cc2f5b872601ee4f07b47e65ab8.webm?t=1731341974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Create loadouts for any situation. Will you be a slow and heavy death machine with thick panser? Will you be up close and personal? or will you bombard your enemies with a weapon-centric glasscanon mech? Does your team require a healer stay alive. The possibilities are endless in the engineering room.<br><br>The mech building system offers tons of possibilities, with 4+ weaponslots, 20+ weapons for those slots and 10+ part slots with unique stats and special abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/5c32a84a4a535ba362e2a96ad559cac4.webp?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br>Choose from a wide selection of game modes, with varying objectives, rules, perks and team sizes. Venture into PVE for a roguelite Co-Op or singleplayer experience that offers high replayability and demand an even higher skill level.<br><br>Want to know more? Shoot us some questions on our . See you on the battlefield!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/5c8cf99436cb99d338fdef1a938cba17.avif?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=179 /></span><br><br><strong>Cogs and Carnage</strong> is a roguelite topdown shooter with focus on fast paced fights and massive destruction. Adapt your mech to suit the playstyle you and your party need to succeed in a wide range of gamemodes, offering different objectives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/3964288618b2e8beeed67c2aa2e6f827.webp?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/4e8f977273a9c98bd6d8ff398688f969.poster.avif?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/4e8f977273a9c98bd6d8ff398688f969.webm?t=1731341974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Team up with friends or go solo and fight challenging enemies or other players.<br>Use simple controls to position yourself tactically, dodge incoming attacks or aim destructive skill-shots.  Engage in battles of all sizes, as you proof yourself against the toughest mech pilot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/e5b2a331731ddd1699853a2ada0ee027.webp?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/4abf0cc2f5b872601ee4f07b47e65ab8.poster.avif?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/4abf0cc2f5b872601ee4f07b47e65ab8.webm?t=1731341974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Create loadouts for any situation. Will you be a slow and heavy death machine with thick panser? Will you be up close and personal? or will you bombard your enemies with a weapon-centric glasscanon mech? Does your team require a healer stay alive. The possibilities are endless in the engineering room.<br><br>The mech building system offers tons of possibilities, with 4+ weaponslots, 20+ weapons for those slots and 10+ part slots with unique stats and special abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837960/extras/5c32a84a4a535ba362e2a96ad559cac4.webp?t=1731341974\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br>Choose from a wide selection of game modes, with varying objectives, rules, perks and team sizes. Venture into PVE for a roguelite Co-Op or singleplayer experience that offers high replayability and demand an even higher skill level.<br><br>Want to know more? Shoot us some questions on our . See you on the battlefield!",
    "short_description": "Cogs and Carnage is a solo and co-op roguelite Action-shooter where you play as a Mechsuit pilot and engineer. Enter your hangar, customize your mechsuit to your playstyle and take it out to wreak havoc on the battlefield! The game offers endless fast paced action for you and your friends.",
